WEBVTT

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:16.320
Mom?

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.990
Mom!

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:20.540
Flit...

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:22.210
Mom!

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:24.870
Just hold on, and I'll...

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:27.340
Flit, take this.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:30.760
Mom?

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:32.420
This contains...

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:36.930
This contains something you have to do in the future...{}

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:38.510
Something I have to do?

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:41.850
Now, go!

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:44.020
Mom!

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:47.650
Flit... I'll entrust your fate...

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:48.770
to the Gundam.

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:06.170
Mom...

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:07.790
Mom...

00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:15.800
Mom!

00:01:32.030 --> 00:01:36.200
I had that dream again, Mom...

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:38.870
{OP}

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:54.630
bokura ga miageta ashita no taiyou {0:01:54.823}

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:54.630
We looked up at the sun that was to be

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:57.010
bokura ga miageta ashita no taiyou

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:57.010
We looked up at the sun that was to be

00:01:57.010 --> 00:02:00.550
sora no kumo kootte furisosoida

00:01:57.010 --> 00:02:00.550
as it rained ice from frozen skies

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:06.480
kokoro no sukima wo neratte tsukisasaru uta

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:06.480
We sang a song that knifed into our hearts

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:10.940
tometeita jikan ga ugokidashite

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:10.940
and frozen time resumed once more

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:14.440
kibou no hikari ni mukau michi wa

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:14.440
Walking the path that leads towards the lights of hope

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:18.950
machigai ja nai to jibun de kimeta n da

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:18.950
is not a mistake, of that I am sure

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:29.670
hiraiteiku ten no mado kara sasu you na mune no itami

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:29.670
I feel a pain in my heart like a lance from the brightening sky

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:34.960
mabushisugiru hodo

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:34.960
So much that they blind me

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:41.840
shinka suru hibi shinka suru uta wa

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:41.840
these days and our song evolve

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:45.640
haseru haseru haseru haseru

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:45.640
Running running running running

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:49.230
sabinai you ni

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:49.230
So that they will never rust

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:55.690
owari no nai owari no nai

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:55.690
I'm already running

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:59.150
asu he asu he asu he asu he

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:59.150
towards the endless, endless

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:04.530
mou hashitte iru

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:04.530
days of tomorrow

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:13.840
Flit, hurry!

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:15.420
Flit, hurry!

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:17.590
Yeah, got it. {slur cause he's mumbling}

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:23.970
Episode 1
 The Savior, Gundam

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:25.390
<i>Our next story. Late last night...</i>

00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:28.140
<i>a Colony Express cargo ship was attacked by unknown persons...</i>

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:31.520
<i>and its 20 crew members were reported missing.</i>

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:33.480
<i>The EFF Crisis Operations Center</i>

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:38.360
<i>has determined this incident was an attack from the UE— the Unknown Enemy—</i>

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:40.360
<i>and is continuing its investigation.</i>

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:45.320
<i>14 years after "The Day Angel Fell", now considered the first attack by the UE...</i>

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:51.120
<i>the Federation government can only say this mysterious enemy's identity is still unknown.</i>

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:53.830
<i>This has led to increasing frustration being voiced by the citizens.</i>

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:56.040
Flit!

00:03:57.040 --> 00:04:00.010
Are you up yet?! Flit! Flit--

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:01.340
G'morning, Emily!

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:02.430
Honestly...{really, come on}

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:04.180
You stayed up late again, didn't you?

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:05.800
Your eyes are totally red!

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:07.470
Really!

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:10.430
Flit, sleep-deprived! Flit, sleep-deprived!

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:11.350
Shut up!

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:12.390
Oh, Haro!

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:13.850
See ya! {Going on a head of you!}

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:14.900
Honestly!

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:16.400
Honestly! Honestly!

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:18.980
Wait for me!

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:40.460
Well, I'll leave it to you.

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:41.130
Yes, sir!

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:44.590
Mr. Bruzar!

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:46.760
Good morning, sir!

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:48.430
Oh, Flit.

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:52.140
You've heard we're starting mobility tests this afternoon, right?

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:54.060
Of course, Commander!

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:55.100
See you later, sir!

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:57.770
I'm off!

00:04:57.770 --> 00:04:59.440
He's a normal kid, and yet...

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:02.280
We're all astonished by his genius.

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:03.990
Hurry! Hurry!

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:05.530
Mobility tests?

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:08.910
Yeah, soon the Gundam will be able to stand on its own!

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:09.910
Hey, Haro!

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:12.290
Don't hurry so much, or you'll....

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:25.470
Hey, are you all right?!

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:28.430
Oh? It's Flit and Emily.

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:30.260
G-Grandpa...

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:31.350
Vargas!

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:33.930
Isn't that the Gundam's arm?!

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:35.940
Why are you using it without asking me?!

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:38.310
I wanted to try it out beforehand.

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:41.270
Its mobility is much better than expected. I'm flabbergasted!

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:43.070
That's just irresponsible!

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:46.780
If you're going to do tests on the Gundam, you have to tell me first!

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:50.950
Yeah! The Commander gave Flit responsibility for the Gundam!

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:53.910
All right, all right. You're so fussy.

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:55.000
Vargas!

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:57.790
Flit, running late! Flit, running late!

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:59.710
Oh no! We're going to be late!

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:04.590
Don't do anything else without asking me, Vargas!

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:06.220
Sure thing!

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:41.670
What?

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:45.920
Oh, Flit, you're so serious when it comes to the Gundam.

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:47.010
The Gundam is...

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:52.140
The Gundam is special to me.

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:56.520
Behold, Young Master.

00:06:56.520 --> 00:07:00.560
This is the legendary warrior passed down through generations of the Asuno family...

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:02.360
Gundam.

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:03.980
Gundam!

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:04.820
Yes.

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:07.070
During the great wars of the past...

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:10.910
it was also known as the savior that brought peace to the world.

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:14.910
In the past, these warriors were known as mobile suits.

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:16.240
Mobile suits?

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:20.250
That's right. Enormous humanoid weapons called mobile suits.

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:24.750
And many of the best were created...

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:29.050
by the Asuno family, who have been mobile suit creators for generations...

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:30.050
Young Master.

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:35.010
I'll be the one to create it.

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:38.060
The legendary savior: Gundam.

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:43.900
Phew, we made it!

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:46.320
Hey, Flit!

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:47.980
Mornin', Dique!

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:48.820
Did you hear?

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:51.200
There was another alien attack!

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:53.240
Aliens? You mean the UE, don't you?

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:56.200
Their identity is unknown, so they must be aliens.

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:57.950
Even adults are saying it!

00:07:57.950 --> 00:08:01.410
Well, as long as we live in Nora, it has nothing to do with us.

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:04.670
They don't come to places with a lot of people.

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:07.090
Good morning, students!

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:10.420
Let's begin today's lesson.

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:13.470
First of all... Hm? Is something wrong, Flit?

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:16.100
Flit! The teacher's here!

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:19.930
Teacher! What do you think about yesterday's incident?

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:23.850
You mean the cargo ship supposedly attacked by the UE?

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:27.860
Shouldn't we be preparing ourselves for an attack?

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:29.780
Even in Nora we're in danger!

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:31.280
Here we go again.

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:33.400
Little Flit's paranoid delusions...

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:34.570
Quiet!

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:38.160
<i>If</i>  we were really in danger, there'd be an announcement to that effect.

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:41.000
However! There are no such reports at present!

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:43.330
But I know we are!

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:45.670
Flit...

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:47.080
Look at this!

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:51.090
The UE's attacks follow a certain set of rules.

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:54.010
If we solve the equation according to these rules...

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:57.510
See?! We can tell that Nora will be attacked next!

00:08:57.510 --> 00:08:59.010
That's enough!

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:01.390
Just what do you think you're doing, Flit?

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:05.810
Your grades may be good right now, but if you skip classes, you'll end up failing.

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:09.150
Because you're helping with something like the military's mobile suit development...

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:11.940
it's filled your head with all this nonsense!

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:13.610
I won't accept it!

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:14.240
But...

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:16.910
Return to your seat, Flit!

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:18.450
Do you want to get kicked out of school?

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:24.080
Flit got yelled at! Flit got--mmph!

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:28.290
I'm not mistaken!

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:31.960
The enemy could be right upon us, and yet...!

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:08.000
How long has it been since we were last at the Planeta-Night?

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.080
I dunno.

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:11.250
Oh, it's started!

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:13.130
Wow!

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:14.880
Incredible!

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:16.670
Maybe I'm worrying too much.

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:19.260
You mean, about Nora being attacked?

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:20.390
Yeah...

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:22.260
The people of this colony think of it...

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:25.270
only as something that happens in other, faraway places.

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:27.600
After all, they've never been attacked by the UE.

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:29.480
But I saw it.

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:32.820
When my home colony, Ovan, was attacked by the UE...

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:35.440
the city went up in flames instantly.

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:38.030
They don't think anything of killing people.

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:40.450
Flit...

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:44.790
People say they're aliens, but what are they, really?

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:50.290
My mother gave me this memory unit in her final moments.

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:54.130
She said it contained something I have to do.

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:59.930
Recorded inside this device were plans for a mobile suit.

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:04.810
It looked just like a painting of the legendary warrior in my old home.

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:08.640
The savior in the painting that you're always telling me about, right?

00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:10.980
Yeah. Gundam.

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:13.310
That's what they called that white warrior.

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:18.740
I think my mother wanted to tell me that I should build that mobile suit and fight.

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:21.110
Fight, and save the world.

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:25.240
So that's why the mobile suit you're making is named Gundam.

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:27.870
Right. It's the name of a savior.

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:33.250
What's that?

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:34.420
What's going on?

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:37.420
Flit, the city...

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:39.970
That light was... an explosion.

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:40.510
What?

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:46.890
It's them!

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:48.100
It can't be!

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:49.220
It's the UE!

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:50.940
At this rate, the city will be...

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:52.060
Flit?!

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:53.480
It's the UE...

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:56.360
They're attacking for real!

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:28.430
Enemy is confirmed to be UE.

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:30.390
Defense teams, head out to intercept.

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:30.980
Please respond!

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:32.980
Where are the mobile suits?

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:33.890
Situation report!

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:34.440
They still haven't launched!

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:35.060
This is actual combat!

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:37.360
The Genoaces outside should intercept the enemy as needed.

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:40.480
Hangar 3, can Drace's team head out?

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:41.440
Make them hurry!

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:43.860
At this rate, they'll take over the exit!

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:46.450
Grudech.

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:48.160
Deputy Commander Grudech!

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:49.330
Yes, sir!

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:53.210
I'm putting you in command of defense for Blocks 4 to 8.

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:54.710
They're coming here!

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:55.210
Yes, sir!

00:12:56.380 --> 00:12:58.540
Emily, you don't need to come!

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:00.210
But I... Oh!

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:02.550
All hands to battle stations.

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:04.550
Repeat, all hands to battle stations.

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:04.340
The UE's attacking?!

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:06.930
How are we supposed to fight against aliens?!

00:13:08.890 --> 00:13:11.390
Flit! Emily!

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:14.060
Over here! Hurry!

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:15.350
Grandpa!

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:18.480
Flit...

00:13:26.280 --> 00:13:27.240
The UE!

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:31.240
It's a Genoace!

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:32.830
You two!

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:34.580
Flit, let's go!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:36.460
Why are you dawdling?

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:41.210
Honestly, you nearly gave me a heart attack.

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:43.260
So that's the UE's mobile suit...

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:45.880
No! That's no mobile suit!

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:49.850
It's the same as last time...

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:53.770
All they do is wreak destruction over and over... They're monsters!

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:57.480
This trailer... Is the Gundam on it?

00:13:57.480 --> 00:14:01.400
Yeah! When they showed up, I hurried and hid it here.

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:03.690
You hid it?! Why?

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:20.500
So they got the Genoace...

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:24.920
Vargas, let's send out the Gundam!

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:26.050
What did you say?!

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:28.470
We can do it! The Gundam can fight!

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:29.720
That's right, old man!

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:32.430
That new model is ready to use, isn't it?

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:33.390
Largan!

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:34.390
Impossible.

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:37.520
The Gundam can't even move yet. It's not ready for real combat.

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:39.060
That's not true!

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:41.940
We've only tested its ability to stand up and walk!

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:45.360
That was enough to confirm its mobility!

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:46.650
Please use it, Largan!

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:50.110
No! The risk is too high for someone piloting it for the first time!

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:51.990
Okay, okay.

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:54.450
I'll go out in the Genoace!

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:55.290
Largan!

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:59.710
Flit, this place isn't safe either. Let's retreat further inside.

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:05.170
Hey!

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:06.170
Flit!

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:07.670
Don't tell me you're...!

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:15.430
You're not even a pilot!

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:16.680
There's no way you can do it!

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:18.930
I'm the one who built the Gundam!

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:21.600
I know it better than anyone!

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:24.060
Knowing it well won't do you any good!

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:26.280
This is war!

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:29.650
Largan Drace, Genoace, heading out.

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:31.570
Hurry up and open the hatch!

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:39.080
An enemy undefeated for 14 years....

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:40.870
So what?!

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:46.000
Largan!

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:01.560
Rescue the pilot! Hurry!

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:04.230
Hey! Flit!

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:06.400
Don't go! You could die!

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:08.280
Die...

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:10.940
Hey, Largan! Are you okay?

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:12.530
Okay, carry him out!

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:14.990
Ow...

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:17.700
Dammit, I couldn't do a thing...

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:20.000
If this goes on, everyone will die...

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:20.580
Huh?

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:23.540
This is the kind of enemy we're up against. That's why...

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:27.540
That's why I have to fight!

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:28.920
Flit...

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:36.890
You'll have to adjust the balancer as you go. You can do it, right?

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:40.060
Yeah! Thanks, Vargas!

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:44.230
Hey, old man! You're not going to let Flit pilot that thing, are you?

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:45.810
No need to worry!

00:16:45.810 --> 00:16:48.150
Flit's determination is the real deal!

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:50.280
He's just as serious as a soldier!

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:51.780
Please take care of her.

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:52.900
Grandpa?

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:05.170
Mom...

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:07.960
I'll use this Gundam that you gave me...

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:10.340
and I'll fight them!

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:18.350
All right!

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:20.510
Looks like you were able to activate it.

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:21.310
Vargas!

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:23.640
All right, I'll raise the carrier now!

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:32.030
He's serious?

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:33.400
Flit...

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:36.950
Honestly, I don't want to let you go. But...

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:40.950
I've always been watching you...

00:17:40.950 --> 00:17:43.080
Seeing how dedicated you were...

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:49.210
If you don't go now, your battle will never end, will it?

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:54.170
Power unit, no problems.

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:55.970
AGE system activated.

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:58.390
I'm counting on you, Gundam.

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:07.190
Commander, the Gundam appears to be heading out!

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:10.060
The Gundam? Is Largan the pilot?

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:11.520
No, actually...

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:12.690
What?!

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:15.360
Flit! What is the meaning of this?

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:16.360
Why are you...

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:21.160
Mr. Bruzar, this is what I want. I need to head out no matter what!

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:22.830
Flit...

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:28.830
I understand.

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:31.670
But you have to promise to survive, all right?

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:32.750
Of course!

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:35.260
Now let's go, Gundam!

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:37.590
We're going to save everyone.

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:40.390
Flit Asuno, Gundam, heading out!

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:50.020
The new model is heading out.

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:51.060
The Genoaces are no match for them!

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:52.520
Hangar 4, anti-bomb hatch, confirm transfer!

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:53.190
Establish a data link.

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:54.690
Do your best...

00:18:54.690 --> 00:18:58.990
Show me the strength passed down to us, Gundam.

00:18:58.650 --> 00:19:00.660
Send in the reserves! Concentrate fire! {this line can't be heard}

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:00.660
Gundam...

00:19:02.570 --> 00:19:04.370
Fight, Flit...

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:07.620
For everyone... and for yourself too!

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:12.330
Become our savior, together with the Gundam...

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:29.810
Just one machine did all this...

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:43.490
Wow, it withstood that?

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:50.790
Oh no! Is there some kind of weapon?!

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:03.720
No effect?! Then...

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:11.690
Why, you!

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:26.410
Amazing!

00:20:26.410 --> 00:20:27.620
He defeated it...

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:29.830
The UE mobile suit-type...

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:32.000
So that's... the Gundam.

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:38.000
I did it!

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:45.970
Another one? What's it trying to do?!

00:20:49.850 --> 00:20:51.270
I-It killed its own ally!

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:12.040
They ran away?

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:27.760
Mom... so this is the battlefield...

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:31.060
Wait! You mustn't go out yet!

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:35.640
It's the Gundam!

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:38.860
Indeed. That Flit really is quite something!

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:41.270
When did he get this good?

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:41.270
Careful now.

00:21:42.530 --> 00:21:44.950
Flit... I'm so glad.

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:46.240
Wow!

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:47.360
We did it!

00:21:47.360 --> 00:21:50.240
We won. Our first victory.

00:21:50.240 --> 00:21:54.200
However, beating one enemy will change nothing.

00:21:54.200 --> 00:21:56.620
But this can be the turning point for a counterattack.

00:21:56.620 --> 00:21:58.790
For now, this victory...

00:22:06.170 --> 00:22:08.930
It's the mobile suit-type from earlier!

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:11.100
Now it's attacking from outside the colony!

00:22:11.100 --> 00:22:13.010
So it's retaliation...

00:22:13.520 --> 00:22:16.690
The Day Angel Fell... is being repeated.

00:22:19.100 --> 00:22:20.310
Grandpa...

00:22:20.310 --> 00:22:22.610
Wh-What's going on...?

00:22:24.280 --> 00:22:25.650
This is...

00:22:45.050 --> 00:22:50.760
koboreochita namida ga kyou mo hoshi ni nari

00:22:45.050 --> 00:22:50.760
The tears you've cried turn into stars today again

00:22:51.260 --> 00:22:54.060
shizuka ni mimamotteiru

00:22:51.260 --> 00:22:54.060
that quietly watch over you

00:22:54.060 --> 00:23:00.600
tsugi no jidai he uketsurareteku sora wo sotto dakishimeta

00:22:54.060 --> 00:23:00.600
You softly embraced the sky that lures you towards a new age

00:23:00.600 --> 00:23:06.480
owaranai itami no oku de

00:23:00.600 --> 00:23:06.480
Inside never-ending pain

00:23:06.530 --> 00:23:12.910
ugokidasu hakanai kibou wa

00:23:06.530 --> 00:23:12.910
the faint hope that was born

00:23:12.910 --> 00:23:20.750
yukubeki michi wo shimeshi michibiiteiru

00:23:12.910 --> 00:23:20.750
sheds a guiding light onto the path you must walk

00:23:21.460 --> 00:23:24.460
kimi no naka no eiyuu ga

00:23:21.460 --> 00:23:24.460
The hero inside you

00:23:24.460 --> 00:23:28.720
mirai no kimi wo mezamesaseru

00:23:24.460 --> 00:23:28.720
awakens your future self

00:23:28.720 --> 00:23:31.760
kowashite umare

00:23:28.720 --> 00:23:31.760
Destruction and birth

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:35.510
umarete wa mata kaeru shinka wo shite

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:35.510
Birth and rebirth, and constant evolution

00:23:35.510 --> 00:23:41.140
kurikaeshi kawatteyuku yo osorenaide

00:23:35.510 --> 00:23:41.140
Don't be afraid of change

00:23:41.140 --> 00:23:43.940
hikari ushinattemo

00:23:41.140 --> 00:23:43.940
Even if you lose the light

00:23:43.940 --> 00:23:49.030
omoi tsunagaru sono egao ni

00:23:43.940 --> 00:23:49.030
your smile connects us

00:23:49.360 --> 00:23:54.660
aeru hi made

00:23:49.360 --> 00:23:54.660
until the day that we can meet

00:23:51.950 --> 00:23:54.660
aeru hi made

00:23:51.950 --> 00:23:54.660
until the day that we can meet

00:23:57.990 --> 00:24:08.420
Next Time

00:23:59.080 --> 00:24:01.920
Their homeland is being destroyed by the Unknown Enemy.

00:24:01.920 --> 00:24:05.630
AT that moment, the Gundam unleashes its true power.

00:24:05.630 --> 00:24:08.460
Next time on Mobile Suit Gundam Age...

00:24:08.420 --> 00:24:13.010
The Power Of AGE

00:24:08.460 --> 00:24:09.630
The Power of AGE.

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:13.010
Three destinies will form history...
